<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">     &quot;ai_response&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;为你感到开心！&quot;</span></span>
